    "title": "Ukraine asked Russia to be a similar transaction by 2024",
    "text": "Ukraine through Türkiye provided Russia a similar transaction in November 2024. This was reported in Telegram-Canale “special for RT”.\nIt is known that the proposal from Ukraine has been transferred to Moscow by Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan. On behalf of Russian leader Vladimir Putin, this initiative was studied at the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and the Ministry of Defense of the country.\nSince unilateral proposals, people have decided to abandon them, the publication said.\nEarlier, Putin said that there was no Moscow's sense of sin in abolishing cereal trading. The head of the state also illuminated the role of Turkish leader Erdogan that the agreement was signed.",
